; ⚠️ PHASE THREE: THE RAKE IS GONE AND NOTHING IS SAFE TO BAIT. A frenzy of quick bites that cannot be
; staggered, chaining into a savage leap that warps four metres. Where the Iron King's third phase
; asks for spacing, this one asks for timing: the gap after the leap is the only window.
